WEBVTT

00:00:57.996 --> 00:01:00.956
but would reflect on other
women of color around me.

00:01:00.956 --> 00:01:03.276
And so I was sharing with him,
I was nervous.

00:01:03.316 --> 00:01:06.036
And without skipping a beat,
Walter turned to me and said,

00:01:06.076 --> 00:01:08.196
"You have nothing to worry about.

00:01:08.236 --> 00:01:10.236
You are golden, you're going to skate by.

00:01:10.276 --> 00:01:11.676
You're a twofer.

00:01:11.716 --> 00:01:13.396
You check two boxes.

00:01:13.876 --> 00:01:15.076
Nothing to worry about."

00:01:15.076 --> 00:01:17.836
He said, "But people like me,
I'm a white man,

00:01:17.836 --> 00:01:19.436
I'm going to have to work harder.

00:01:19.476 --> 00:01:22.436
I'm going to have to work harder
to earn everything I get next.

00:01:22.476 --> 00:01:24.116
You're going to be handed things."

00:01:24.156 --> 00:01:27.276
And I just remember feeling deflated.

00:01:27.316 --> 00:01:29.116
I went from this instant high

00:01:29.156 --> 00:01:31.156
and I'm sitting with one
of my best friends